WEBVTT

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:11.750
Your customer starts with your range: olives or fruit, the variety and the product.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:16.550
They pick the calibre, drawn to true scale.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:23.750
Only the packs your lines can fill appear, each with its real closure.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:30.950
Weights follow every choice, inside your approved limits.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:40.550
Their own artwork goes on the real jar, with the lid colour they choose.

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:47.750
Then the case: trays, cartons and film.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:57.350
The pallet and the container are worked out for them.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:06.950
Barcodes, lot and best before are checked before any proof.

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:16.550
The full specification is ready, with every drawing and every line.

00:01:16.950 --> 00:01:23.750
It all runs on your own catalogue and your own rules.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:30.950
Olives, fruit and anything else you pack.

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:39.750
Amphora. Private label requests in minutes, not weeks.
